### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiKey = change-me

### Health check (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Translate AR -> RU (default via NLLB_DEFAULT_TARGET_LANGUAGE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "text": "مرحبا كيف حالك"
}

### Translate AR -> RU (explicit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "text": "مرحبا كيف حالك",
  "target_language": "ru"
}

### Translate AR -> UK
POST {{baseUrl}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "text": "مرحبا كيف حالك",
  "target_language": "uk"
}

### Translate validation error (422: empty text)
POST {{baseUrl}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "text": ""
}

### Translate validation error (422: unsupported target_language)
POST {{baseUrl}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "text": "مرحبا",
  "target_language": "de"
}

### Translate unauthorized (401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/translate
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: wrong-key

{
  "text": "مرحبا"
}

### Swagger UI
GET {{baseUrl}}/docs

### OpenAPI schema (runtime)
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json
